*~
*.swp
__pycache__

# Finder leaves these behind after browsing the tree, and jj tracks new files
# automatically, so they turn up in a diff that has nothing to do with them.
.DS_Store

# Scratch output from playwright-cli (page snapshots and screenshots taken
# while checking a change in a browser). Created in whatever directory the
# tool is run from, so match at any depth.
.playwright-cli/

# --- Build and tooling output ---------------------------------------------
# Unanchored, because a stray install in a subdirectory is still not ours.
node_modules
# Anchored, because these are only ever produced at the root and a source
# directory that happens to be called `build` should still be tracked.
/build
/.svelte-kit
/package
/test-results
/playwright-report
/blob-report
/.playwright

vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
